# tools/look/MODE — read by tools/look/build.py.
# The generated stylesheets (theme-cutline.css, theme-light.css) are written WITHOUT the Simple editor's lines until a Simple
# release has added them: the lock that keeps a Simple release from changing the Full editor lets only a Simple release add a line
# that names Simple's own ids and classes. A Simple release turns this to yes (and ships the lines the build then adds); it
# never goes back to no.
simple-lines: no
